6/002-577207bb85.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/002-577207bb85.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n大阪工作人员们的\n留言色纸和\n插画！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n非常开心！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n于是……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/003-7b0eb48c25.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/003-7b0eb48c25.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1107\" height=\"535\"></a></figure>\n\n还有大量替身可达鸭！\n到处都是（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n而且……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n竟然\n            <br>\n\n\n工作人员\n还给我做了\nT恤！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/004-84c680104a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/004-84c680104a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好厉害！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n穿上试试……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/005-90c7d3ba26.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/005-90c7d3ba26.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure> \n敌方训练家（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/006-eeb98c3528.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/006-eeb98c3528.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n背面是\n关系要好的\n可达鸭和仙子伊布！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/007-659e3da865.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/007-659e3da865.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"333\" height=\"269\"></a></figure>\n\n领口处还有可达鸭的标签（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n太棒了，\n所以临时决定穿着这件T恤\n去参加签名会（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/008-6c229f2a4b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/008-6c229f2a4b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"367\" height=\"606\"></a></figure>\n\n\n穿着呢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大阪宝可梦中心的\n各位工作人员，\n承蒙关照了！\n真的非常感谢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">やってきました控室！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/001-31f668d4e2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/001-31f668d4e2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n        いろんな表情のコダックと\nサン・ムーンの3匹も！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/002-577207bb85.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/002-577207bb85.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nオーサカのスタッフさんの\nメッセージ色紙と\nイラストが！！\n\n<br>\n\n\nとても嬉しいです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/003-7b0eb48c25.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/003-7b0eb48c25.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1107\" height=\"535\"></a></figure>\n\n大量のみがわりコダックも！\nあちらこちらに（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさらに・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nなんと\n            <br>\n\n\nスタッフさんが\nTシャツ\n作ってくれてました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/004-84c680104a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/004-84c680104a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n凄すぎる！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n来てみると・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/005-90c7d3ba26.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/005-90c7d3ba26.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure> \n敵トレーナー（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/006-eeb98c3528.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/006-eeb98c3528.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n後ろには\n仲よしな\nコダックとニンフィア！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/007-659e3da865.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/007-659e3da865.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"333\" height=\"269\"></a></figure>\n\n首元にはコダックのタグ（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n素晴らしいので\n急遽このTシャツを着て\nサイン会する事にしました（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/008-6c229f2a4b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3750246/008-6c229f2a4b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"367\" height=\"606\"></a></figure>\n\n\n着てますよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nポケモンセンターオーサカの\nスタッフのみなさん\nお世話になりました！\n本当にありがとうございました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}